                          "text":  "In May 2009 my wheels broke through a crust into soft sand, and I was stuck. My team spent months trying to drive me out. When winter came I could not tilt my solar panels toward the Sun.\n\nMy last message reached Earth on March 22, 2010. My team kept calling for more than a year, just in case. I am still here beside Home Plate. I did not find a lake. I found something nobody was looking for, with a wheel that did not work.",
